      "updated": 1790777935037,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "\"tree shaking\"\n- Classes cannot be tree-shaken\n    - service class, 42 methods, but you are only using two in your application.\n        - \"shared\" service across the application, where some parts use some methods, and other use different ones.\n    - if you are using functions (composing function) - those CAN be tree-shaken.\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "\"tree shaking\"\n- Classes cannot be tree-shaken\n    - service class, 42 methods, but you are only using two in your application.\n        - \"shared\" service across the application, where some parts use some methods, and other use different ones.\n    - if you are using functions (composing function) - those CAN be tree-shaken.\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    }
  ],
